  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram shows six electrical equipotential lines. An electron is placed on the <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0\"></span> V line and released. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The gravitational force on the electron is negligible. What is true about the direction in which the electron moves and about the acceleration of the electron?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction in which the electron moves</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Acceleration of the electron</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Upwards</td>\n<td>Increasing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Downwards</td>\n<td>Increasing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Upwards</td>\n<td>Decreasing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Downwards</td>\n<td>Decreasing</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
